# Connecting a Wireless Mouse and Keyboard

## Objective

Connect a wireless mouse and keyboard to a laptop using a USB wireless receiver and verify that both devices function correctly.

## Equipment

* Laptop
* Wireless mouse
* Wireless keyboard
* USB wireless receiver

## Procedure

### Step 1 — Connect the USB Receiver

The USB wireless receiver was connected to an available USB port on the laptop.

**Result:**
The laptop detected the wireless receiver.

