## Testing

The mouse was tested by moving the cursor and clicking different areas of the screen.

The keyboard was tested by typing text into a text editor.

**Result:**
Both wireless input devices functioned correctly.

## What I Learned

This lab demonstrated how wireless input devices communicate with a computer through a USB receiver using radio frequency (RF) communication. I also practiced connecting and testing external computer peripherals.

